# Ejemplos de Requests HTTP
# Para usar con curl, Postman, Insomnia, etc.

BASE_URL="http://localhost:8787"

### Health Check
GET {{BASE_URL}}/health

### ========================================
### PRODUCTOS
### ========================================

### Listar todos los productos
GET {{BASE_URL}}/products

### Buscar productos
GET {{BASE_URL}}/products?search=mouse

### Obtener producto específico
GET {{BASE_URL}}/products/prod_1

### ========================================
### CARRITOS
### ========================================

### Crear un carrito nuevo
POST {{BASE_URL}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json

### Obtener carrito (reemplazar con ID real)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_lx9k8m3n4p2

### Agregar producto al carrito (qty por defecto = 1)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_lx9k8m3n4p2/prod_1
Content-Type: application/json

### Agregar producto con cantidad específica
POST {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_lx9k8m3n4p2/prod_2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qty": 3
}

### Actualizar cantidad de un item
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_lx9k8m3n4p2/items/item_abc123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qty": 5
}

### Eliminar item del carrito
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_lx9k8m3n4p2/items/item_abc123

### ========================================
### CASOS DE ERROR
### ========================================

### Producto no existe (404)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/products/prod_999

### Stock insuficiente (409)
POST {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_lx9k8m3n4p2/prod_1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qty": 1000
}

### Cantidad inválida (400)
PUT {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_lx9k8m3n4p2/items/item_abc123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qty": -5
}

### Carrito no existe (404)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/carts/cart_noexiste
